---
import AddFields from './AddFields.astro';
---

<div class="form-shell">
  <header class="add-head">
    <p class="form-kicker">新建菜谱</p>
    <h1 class="form-title">添加菜谱</h1>
    <p class="form-hint">
      从上往下填，最后生成一份 Markdown 和压缩好的封面图，丢进菜谱库就行。
    </p>
  </header>

  <AddFields />

  <div class="form-actions">
    <button type="button" class="sketch-btn btn-primary">生成 Markdown</button>
    <button type="button" class="sketch-btn">存为草稿</button>
    <button type="button" class="sketch-btn">清空</button>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .add-head {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
</style>
